+# candidate/0001 — the reviewer's executable branch (NEVER MERGED)
+
+*(R8-3: no version literals live here — the candidate draft version is
+stated ONCE, in the spec's Version row; this branch tracks it.)*
+
+Authorized by the project owner 2026-08-23 as review evidence for the
+0001 rounds. The spec is NOT accepted; nothing here ships. Apply the
+patch in an extracted review tree:
+
+    patch -p1 < specs/evidence/0001/candidate.patch
+    PYTHONPATH=src python -m pytest tests/test_0001_candidate.py -q -p no:randomly
+
+## What is implemented (the named trio, real)
+
+- `EvidenceAuthor.ASSISTANT` + the I11 fail-closed disclosure clause
+- I12 pair-keyed origin labels (capping axis first, per Q5)
+- the I6 assertable reserve BEFORE truncation, reserved days seeding
+  covered-day state (R5-2/R6-4), green at coverage_share 0.0 AND 0.25
+- SCHEMA v11: I13a (SCHEMA_V11 = SCHEMA_V10), stamp-only migration
+  across constructor/v6/v9 routes (I13b), v11 inheriting ALL FIVE
+  accepted v10 manifestations with a re-qualified runtime (I13c — the
+  0007 machinery itself demanded the re-record, which is that guard
+  working)
+- exact `StoreVersionError(reason="newer")` refusal; FORMAT_VERSION 9
+- MCP/CLI author surfaces extended (self-demotion; `system` stays out)
+
+`tests/test_0001_candidate.py`: **21 passed** (the round-10 fold adds
+the R10-1 bananas vector — an unrelated assertable must not displace a
+relevant fact; the round-9 fold added the
+R9-1 non-functional placement vector — the one assertable record
+globally last-ranked under `has_pet`, complete ordered output asserted,
+proven to FAIL against the pre-fix filter-shaped selection — and the
+dedup vector now asserts the complete order; the round-7/8 set stands:
+the §4b label order verbatim with the complete matrix, the exact
+five-shape migration tests from the authority's object records, the
+real `test_downgrade_export_fails_cleanly`, the I6 composition vectors
+with exact-ID/order assertions).
+
+## The measured blast radius (NOT fixed here — deliberately)
+
+Full suite on this branch — **GENERATED, not typed** (R11-1: these
+figures were carried forward and incremented by inference while this
+very paragraph claimed they were re-run; they now have exactly ONE
+producer). Every figure in this file is written from
+`specs/evidence/0001/candidate_results.json`, which
+`specs/evidence/0001/measure_candidate.py` produces by applying THIS
+patch to a clean tree at the base commit and running both suites;
+`specs/check_candidate_results.py` refuses any disagreement between the
+record, the patch's own bytes and this file — in the sealer's
+extraction checks, so a stale count cannot reach a package:
+
+    measured 2026-08-24: 16 failed, 1813 passed, 20 skipped
+    environment: CPython 3.12.3, Linux-7.0.0-1010-aws-x86_64-glibc2.39
+    command: python -m pytest tests/ -q
+    base: main @ 59cd1cf + this branch's patch
+
+(The split moves with main: it was 1798/9 on 2026-08-23 at `9257e85`,
+before 0024's mechanism, the P1/P4 gates and the A1 evidence work
+landed; the reviewer's sandbox saw the same 16 failures at a different
+split again, which is optional-dependency availability, not behaviour.
+The FAILURE SET is the claim, and the record carries it item by item.) Five of the 16 are NEW
+carriers of the round-7 §4b label fix — the three `test_render_origin`
+pins (NOTE: the verbatim decision order CHANGES the rendered label for
+existing user+3P/system+3P edges from "third-party-reported" to
+"third-party-derived" — a disclosed rendering behaviour change at
+implementation), the 0005 import-callsite manifest (this file's own new
+calls), and the historical R2-MARKER closure pinning the old label map.
+The original eleven stand. Every failure is a
+CARRIER the spec's §2/§2d enumerates, now measured by execution rather
+than asserted: the FORMAT-9 pin family (0006/0014/0019/S7), the MCP
+author-message pins, the 0018 preflight matrix head, the generated
+authority tables, the 0013 migration oracle domain, and the audit
+manifest line shifts. These are the implementation obligations
+acceptance authorises; fixing them on an evidence branch would be
+implementing the spec before acceptance.
